From afc9e36cdcf1601336776147893581650410569e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mlgprorektm8 <67933lance@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:21:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Splitscreen, controller ports, display modes, DLSS frame
 generation, menu bar fixes

- Players 2-4: the input bridge forwards each controller to its own pad
  slot and logs players in through Ryty's user service; controller port
  preferences (by USB id) and a keyboard player from the launcher.
- Exclusive fullscreen at a chosen resolution and refresh rate
  (GPU.fullscreen_refresh_rate).
- DLSS frame generation through NVIDIA Streamline (GPU.dlssg_enabled):
  the interposer stands in for vulkan-1.dll; zero motion vectors and flat
  depth are tagged. Streamline headers vendored (MIT).
- Race preview top bar flicker: no GPU waits while the menu bar is shown
  (FIX-127), EOP fences not held (FIX-126), crops refreshed from the
  newest full image (FIX-129), barrier before feedback-loop draws
  (FIX-130). Diagnostics DIAG-134..141 (env-gated).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
